{"id": "en_tsunami_p2", "total": 79.39, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. The first wave hit the hotel, but freezing snow now falls on the exposed roof.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.18}, {"text": "Below in the dark night, violent water surges through the drowned streets of the coastal town.", "start": 5.74, "end": 9.8}, {"text": "Mark knows he cannot stay exposed on the roof as freezing winter temperatures drop rapidly tonight.", "start": 10.48, "end": 14.4}, {"text": "Some wet survivors on the roof want to run downstairs to find warm cars on the road.", "start": 15.0, "end": 18.64}, {"text": "One. Mark stops them because the first wave is often not the biggest wave during a tsunami.", "start": 19.2, "end": 23.64}, {"text": "More dangerous waves can keep coming for hours, crashing against the lower walls of the concrete building.", "start": 24.26, "end": 28.6}, {"text": "Two. He leads the shivering group just inside the reinforced concrete stairwell on the 10th floor.", "start": 28.6, "end": 33.88}, {"text": "They stay high above the 4th floor where the violent ocean surge cannot reach their safe shelter.", "start": 34.22, "end": 38.16}, {"text": "Inside the sealed stairwell, they find thick emergency blankets and stay completely sheltered from freezing cold snow.", "start": 38.78, "end": 43.64}, {"text": "Outside, a massive second surge of black water crashes across the town, smashing parked vehicles below.", "start": 44.32, "end": 49.4}, {"text": "Three. Everyone stays inside the upper floor of the building until official rescue teams arrive at dawn.", "start": 50.14, "end": 55.0}, {"text": "Never rush back down early because dangerous secondary waves continue hitting the coastline for many hours.", "start": 55.0, "end": 60.38}, {"text": "Emergency responders on rescue boats announce over megaphones that the deadly ocean surges have finally stopped.", "start": 61.04, "end": 65.8}, {"text": "Mark survived by climbing high into strong concrete shelter and refusing to leave his secure position.", "start": 66.46, "end": 70.92}, {"text": "Stay high above the 4th floor until officials declare the coast safe. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 71.56, "end": 76.24}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.32], ["two.", 0.251, 0.503], ["The", 1.28, 1.34], ["first", 1.34, 1.6], ["wave", 1.6, 1.76], ["hit", 1.76, 2.0], ["the", 2.0, 2.12], ["hotel,", 2.12, 2.36], ["but", 2.66, 2.8], ["freezing", 2.8, 3.16], ["snow", 3.16, 3.54], ["now", 3.54, 3.94], ["falls", 3.94, 4.18], ["on", 4.18, 4.48], ["the", 4.48, 4.58], ["exposed", 4.58, 4.86], ["roof.", 4.86, 5.18], ["Below", 5.74, 6.08], ["in", 6.08, 6.3], ["the", 6.3, 6.38], ["dark", 6.38, 6.52], ["night,", 6.52, 6.76], ["violent", 7.1, 7.32], ["water", 7.32, 7.6], ["surges", 7.6, 8.0], ["through", 8.0, 8.3], ["the", 8.3, 8.44], ["drowned", 8.44, 8.64], ["streets", 8.64, 9.02], ["of", 9.02, 9.22], ["the", 9.22, 9.32], ["coastal", 9.32, 9.5], ["town.", 9.5, 9.8], ["Mark", 10.48, 10.66], ["knows", 10.66, 10.8], ["he", 10.8, 11.0], ["cannot", 11.0, 11.28], ["stay", 11.28, 11.56], ["exposed", 11.56, 11.82], ["on", 11.82, 12.08], ["the", 12.08, 12.16], ["roof", 12.16, 12.34], ["as", 12.34, 12.5], ["freezing", 12.5, 12.86], ["winter", 12.86, 13.1], ["temperatures", 13.1, 13.48], ["drop", 13.48, 13.74], ["rapidly", 13.74, 14.12], ["tonight.", 14.12, 14.4], ["Some", 15.0, 15.28], ["wet", 15.28, 15.46], ["survivors", 15.46, 15.82], ["on", 15.82, 16.0], ["the", 16.0, 16.08], ["roof", 16.08, 16.26], ["want", 16.26, 16.54], ["to", 16.54, 16.66], ["run", 16.66, 16.82], ["downstairs", 16.82, 17.16], ["to", 17.16, 17.44], ["find", 17.44, 17.6], ["warm", 17.6, 17.82], ["cars", 17.82, 18.12], ["on", 18.12, 18.36], ["the", 18.36, 18.44], ["road.", 18.44, 18.64], ["One.", 19.2, 19.48], ["Mark", 20.0, 20.3], ["stops", 20.3, 20.62], ["them", 20.62, 20.86], ["because", 20.86, 21.2], ["the", 21.2, 21.34], ["first", 21.34, 21.52], ["wave", 21.52, 21.7], ["is", 21.7, 21.86], ["often", 21.86, 22.12], ["not", 22.12, 22.34],